  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are skeptical of or cynical about anti-hate legislation, particularly those who may hold views that perceive such laws as biased or exclusionary toward white males. The meme is designed to provoke controversy and spread misinformation by distorting the purpose of anti-hatred resolutions, thereby appealing to audiences who are already predisposed to distrust or mock civil rights laws. The use of Nancy Pelosi’s image and the false claim about 'exclusion' targets those who may be politically motivated to undermine systemic racism discourse, and who may be drawn to memes that frame anti-hate laws as unfair or discriminatory toward a specific demographic group.",
